{{define "content"}}
<section class="initialization-page">
<h1>初始化权威端</h1>
<ol class="initialization-steps">
{{range .InitializationSteps}}
<li{{if .Current}} class="current"{{else if .Done}} class="done"{{end}}>{{.Label}}</li>
{{end}}
</ol>
{{if .InitializationError}}<div class="operation-refusal"><p>{{.InitializationError}}</p></div>{{end}}
<div class="operation-result">
<p>将创建本机 vault，并生成一个随机主密钥文件用于加密 vault。创建后再设置管理员口令。</p>
<form method="post" action="/ui/init/server/vault/create">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<button type="submit">创建 vault</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>
{{end}}
